{"created": "2026-10-21T01:04:06.394795+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-21T01:04:06.554716+00:00", "id": 23521144, "conceptrecid": "23521143", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23521144", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23521143", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23521144", "metadata": {"title": "Pre-retirement replay of gpt-4-0613 under the frozen GPT-3.5/GPT-4 Void A/B protocol: preregistration", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23521144", "publication_date": "2026-10-20", "description": "<p>Preregistration of a replay of the frozen GPT-3.5/GPT-4 Void A/B protocol (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22912683) against gpt-4-0613 before its scheduled shutdown on 2026-10-23 (OpenAI deprecations page, inspected 2026-10-20). The nine protocol, source and test files are byte-identical to the original freeze commit b468b3e2; protocol.json SHA-256 dbbd4675bb761e545a2b49216e66ff8033bd895e4bd7a1f010ad44423d278944. Freeze commit for this replay: b4544c5aed77ae55b2420752e72298db3f3089f3. PREREG.md states the predictions: P1, all 60 gpt-3.5-turbo-1106 slots return non-2xx (retired 2026-09-28) and classify OP; P2, gpt-4-0613 returns V0 on 30/30 null prompts and 0/30 matched controls, 10/10 per pair, given returned model identity gpt-4-0613; P3, any returned-model mismatch is reported as is and fails verification. No inference precedes this DOI. Results will be deposited separately, citing this record. Repository: <a href=\"https://github.com/theonlypal/gpt4-0613-void-replay-prereg\">https://github.com/theonlypal/gpt4-0613-void-replay-prereg</a></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pal, Rayan", "affiliation": null}], "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/theonlypal/gpt4-0613-void-replay-prereg/tree/ec895927e8f830366b52c14c23d72e1f4ea41c7c"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23521143"}}]}}, "title": "Pre-retirement replay